audio BGS "res://assets/audio/sfx/Night - Sound.wav" [loop="true"]
[background arg="res://assets/backgrounds/cemetery_night.png" fade="1.0" wait="true"]
Narrator: The weird silhouette turns and reveals itself.
Narrator: The creature has grey skin, white hair with a part of his vertices visible. It's like his neck's skin is transparent.
join Nyo center [animation="Fade In" length="1.0" wait="true"]
if {ChapterTracking.is_evil} == true:
	catherine: *surprised*
	audio "res://assets/audio/sfx/DARK ENERGY - Soundt.wav" [volume="-10.0"]
	Nyo (Nyo_angry): Grr...What brings a mere human to my hideout? Why are you following me, little brat?
	catherine: *Frozen* I... I didn't mean to intrude, I swear.
	- Respond with kindness and understanding
		catherine: I'm sorry for startling you. I only followed out of curiosity. I meant no harm, and I still mean none.
		Nyo (Nyo_surprised): ...Curiosity. Most who say that are lying. You, oddly, might not be.
		leave Nyo [animation="Fade Out" length="0.0" wait="true"]
		set {EndingTracking.marloch_feeling} += 1.0
		[background arg="res://assets/backgrounds/BlackBaground.png" fade="1.0" wait="true"]
	- Respond with fear and disdain
		catherine: Stay back! I don't want any trouble from a thing like you.
		Nyo (Nyo_angry): "A thing." Charming. I expected nothing more from humans like you.
		Nyo (Nyo_angry): Just because I .. or we look different, right? RIGHT?
		Nyo (Nyo_angry): "A thing." Charming. Go home, human, before your manners get you hurt.
		leave Nyo [animation="Fade Out" length="0.0" wait="true"]
		set {EndingTracking.marloch_feeling} -= 1.0
		[background arg="res://assets/backgrounds/BlackBaground.png" fade="1.0" wait="true"]
else:
	Nyo (Nyo_surprised): ...You're not screaming. Most humans scream when they see me for the first time.
	catherine: I’ve heard countless tales about creatures like you. And from what I’ve heard in this town, should I be?
	Nyo (Nyo_angry): Depends on what you plan to do next.
	- Dismiss him, keep your distance
		catherine: I don't know what you are. Just stay away from me.
		Nyo (Nyo_surprised): Hahaha, you are the one that followed me to this cemetery.
		Nyo (Nyo_angry): And you are alone here. Do you think something will find you if something happens?
		Nyo (Nyo_angry): No one knows you yet, you might as well be gone and no one would bat an eye.
		catherine: I need to run away. I need to run away now.
		leave Nyo [animation="Fade Out" length="0.0" wait="true"]
		[background arg="res://assets/backgrounds/BlackBaground.png" fade="1.0" wait="true"]
		Narrator: Catherine ran until she reached a place with some lighting.
		[background arg="res://assets/backgrounds/hotel_placeholder.jpg" fade="1.0" wait="true"]
		catherine: Here, I might be safe here. I am going in.
		set {EndingTracking.marloch_feeling} -= 1.0
		[background arg="res://assets/backgrounds/BlackBaground.png" fade="1.0" wait="true"]
	- Validate him, stay and talk
		catherine: I don't know what you really are. But my mother told countless tales about some magical creatures in this town. I suppose you are one of them?
		Nyo (Nyo_angry): Quite bold of you to stay. Well, I think it's obvious that I am not really.. human.
		catherine: I am not going to stir the pot. I need to know. Are you the one who can fulfil any desires? I am sick and I...
		Nyo (Nyo_angry): Stop right there, why the hurry. Don't you even feel threatened?
		catherine: I... feel threat.. I need help? I need help because I am dying.
		Nyo (Nyo_talk): I see.. well. This town is a place of mystery. You might find who you are searching for here. But sadly, that's not me.
		Narrator: Nyo melts back into the  cemetery. Word, somehow, is spreading faster and further in Shateroo.
		leave Nyo [animation="Fade Out" length="1.0" wait="true"]
		catherine: Wait, then who is it?
		Narrator: The town's creatures all seem to know each other. I think if I continue to go out at night, I will find him, or her.. or them..
		catherine: He disappeared, I feel I should get a place to go right now.
